<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Playground — Hydra Guide</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#fff;--bg-soft:#f6f8f8;--bg-panel:#fff;--bg-code:#f4f6f6;
--text:#0e1a17;--text-soft:#5a6a66;--text-mut:#8a9793;--border:#e2e8e6;--border-strong:#cdd8d5;
--accent:#0f766e;--accent-soft:#d7efeb;--accent-text:#0b5850;--ok:#15803d;--ok-soft:#dcf3e3;
--warn:#b45309;--warn-soft:#fbedd8;--err:#b91c1c;--err-soft:#fbe4e4;
--mono:ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;--sans:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;}
html[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#0d1412;--bg-soft:#111b18;--bg-panel:#131f1b;--bg-code:#0b1310;
--text:#e7efec;--text-soft:#9db0aa;--text-mut:#6f827c;--border:#20302b;--border-strong:#2c413a;
--accent:#2dd4bf;--accent-soft:#123a34;--accent-text:#7bead9;--ok:#4ade80;--ok-soft:#12331f;
--warn:#fbbf24;--warn-soft:#3a2c0e;--err:#f87171;--err-soft:#3a1616;}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:var(--sans);background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
code,.mono{font-family:var(--mono)}
.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;height:56px;padding:0 clamp(12px,3vw,22px);background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;flex-shrink:0}
.logo{width:22px;height:22px;color:var(--accent)}
.nav{display:flex;gap:4px}
.nav a{padding:6px 12px;border-radius:7px;color:var(--text-soft);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none}
.nav a.active{color:var(--accent-text);background:var(--accent-soft)}
.spacer{flex:1}
.search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 12px;width:min(220px,30vw);background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;color:var(--text-mut);font-size:13px;font-family:var(--sans);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer}
.search .k{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:5px;padding:1px 6px}
.iconbtn{display:grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-soft);color:var(--text-soft);cursor:pointer}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text);cursor:pointer}
.btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
.btn.primary{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}
html[data-theme="dark"] .btn.primary{color:#04211d}
.btn.sm{padding:6px 11px;font-size:13px}
button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
.wrap{max-width:1340px;margin:0 auto;padding:18px clamp(12px,3vw,22px) 70px}
.pgbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px}
.pgbar h1{font-size:20px;margin:0;font-weight:600}
.pgbar .badge{font-size:12px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-text);font-weight:500}
.pgbar .right{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.modes{display:flex;padding:2px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:9px;background:var(--bg-soft)}
.modebtn{border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--text-soft);padding:4px 10px;border-radius:7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.modebtn.on{background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--accent-text);box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
/* examples bar */
.examples{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.exlab{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--text-mut);font-weight:600;flex-shrink:0}
select.exsel{padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:9px;background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text);font-size:13.5px;font-family:var(--sans);cursor:pointer;min-width:290px;max-width:100%}
.exhint{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-mut)}
.run-main{margin-left:auto}
.jobflow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;background:var(--bg-panel)}
.jfnode{min-width:104px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:9px;background:var(--bg-soft);text-align:center}
.jfnode.transform{min-width:220px;border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft)}
.jfnode .n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}
.jfnode .s{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--text-mut);margin-top:2px}
.jfnode.transform .s{color:var(--accent-text)}
.jfarr{color:var(--text-mut);font-size:17px}
.runstate{margin-left:auto;font-size:11.5px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--bg-soft);color:var(--text-mut);white-space:nowrap}
.runstate.ok{background:var(--ok-soft);color:var(--ok)}
.runstate.err{background:var(--err-soft);color:var(--err)}
.runstate.stale{background:var(--warn-soft);color:var(--warn)}
.stage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:224px minmax(0,1fr) 224px;gap:12px;align-items:start}
.panel{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:13px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-panel);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.panel-h{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;padding:9px 13px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-mut);letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.side .body{padding:11px;display:flex;flex:1;min-height:0;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;overflow-y:auto}
.srcgroup h5{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--text-mut);margin:2px 0 5px;font-weight:600}
.sitem{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid transparent;user-select:none}
.sitem:hover{background:var(--bg-soft)}
.sitem.on{background:var(--accent-soft)}
.sitem .si{width:24px;height:20px;border-radius:5px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;font-family:var(--mono);flex-shrink:0}
.si.file{background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-text)}
.si.db{background:var(--warn-soft);color:var(--warn)}
.si.api{background:var(--ok-soft);color:var(--ok)}
.sitem .snm{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}
.sitem .sty{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--text-mut);margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono)}
.dcap{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--text-mut);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;margin-bottom:4px}
.preview-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}
.preview-all{border:none;background:none;color:var(--accent);font-size:10.5px;cursor:pointer;padding:2px 0}
.conn{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:9px 11px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg-soft)}
.conn .ic{width:26px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;font-family:var(--mono);flex-shrink:0}
.conn .nm{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.conn .ty{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-mut);font-family:var(--mono)}
.caps{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:2px}
.cap{font-size:10.5px;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text-soft)}
.cap.hi{background:var(--warn-soft);color:var(--warn);border-color:transparent}
.wrote{font-size:12px;color:var(--ok);font-weight:600}
.mini{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px}
.mini th{text-align:left;color:var(--text-mut);font-weight:600;padding:3px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:9.5px;text-transform:uppercase}
.mini td{padding:3px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px}
.mini tr:nth-child(even) td{background:var(--bg-soft)}
.files{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-auto-rows:1fr;gap:10px;min-height:300px}
.stage.guided .files{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.stage.guided .file.mut{display:none}
.stage.guided .file.active textarea{min-height:300px}
.file{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:11px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:var(--bg-panel)}
.file.active{border-color:var(--accent)}
.file-h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:6px 11px;font-size:12px;font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--text-soft);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-soft)}
.file-h .d{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--accent)}
.file.mut .file-h .d{background:var(--text-mut)}
.file-h .role{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--text-mut);margin-left:2px}
.file-h .hbtn{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent-text);background:var(--accent-soft);border:none;border-radius:6px;padding:2px 8px;cursor:pointer}
.file textarea{width:100%;flex:1;min-height:100px;resize:vertical;border:none;outline:none;padding:10px 12px;background:transparent;color:var(--text);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}
.file textarea[readonly]{background:var(--bg-soft);color:var(--text-soft);cursor:default}
.yaml-editor{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:42px minmax(0,1fr);flex:1;min-height:360px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-panel)}
.yaml-gutter{position:relative;z-index:3;padding:10px 8px 10px 0;overflow:hidden;border-right:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-soft);color:var(--text-mut);font:11.5px/1.6 var(--mono);text-align:right;user-select:none}
.yaml-code{position:relative;min-width:0;overflow:hidden}
.yaml-highlight,.yaml-input{position:absolute;inset:0;margin:0;padding:10px 12px;border:0;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;font:12px/1.6 var(--mono);tab-size:2}
.yaml-highlight{z-index:1;pointer-events:none;color:var(--text);background:transparent}
.yaml-input{z-index:2;resize:none!important;min-height:0!important;background:transparent!important;color:transparent!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;caret-color:var(--accent-text);outline:none}
.yaml-input::selection{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 24%,transparent);-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}
.yt-key{color:#0b7d70;font-weight:600}.yt-string{color:#a15c13}.yt-number{color:#8957c5}.yt-bool{color:#c2415d;font-weight:600}.yt-comment{color:var(--text-mut);font-style:italic}.yt-punc{color:var(--text-mut)}.yt-op{color:#b45309}
[data-theme="dark"] .yt-key{color:#5eead4}[data-theme="dark"] .yt-string{color:#f6ad55}[data-theme="dark"] .yt-number{color:#c4b5fd}[data-theme="dark"] .yt-bool{color:#fb7185}[data-theme="dark"] .yt-op{color:#fbbf24}
.editor-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:5px 10px 6px 50px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-soft);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--text-mut)}
.editor-foot kbd{font:10px var(--mono);padding:1px 5px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-bottom-width:2px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text-soft)}
.editor-source{margin-left:auto;color:var(--accent-text)}
.ac-panel{position:absolute;z-index:20;left:12px;top:42px;width:min(330px,calc(100% - 24px));max-height:230px;overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg-panel);box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.2);display:none}
.ac-panel.open{display:block}
.ac-title{padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--text-mut);background:var(--bg-soft)}
.ac-item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:22px minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:8px;width:100%;padding:7px 10px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text);text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
.ac-item:last-child{border-bottom:0}.ac-item:hover,.ac-item.on{background:var(--accent-soft)}
.ac-kind{grid-row:1/3;width:22px;height:20px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:5px;background:var(--bg-soft);color:var(--accent-text);font:700 9px var(--mono)}
.ac-name{font:600 12px var(--mono)}.ac-detail{margin-top:2px;overflow:hidden;color:var(--text-mut);font-size:10.5px;white-space:nowrap;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.context-menu{position:fixed;z-index:60;width:220px;display:none;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg-panel);box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.24)}
.context-menu.open{display:block}
.destrow{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.destsel{width:100%;padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text);font-size:12.5px;font-family:var(--sans);cursor:pointer}
.cap.off{opacity:.35;text-decoration:line-through}
.lk{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--text-mut);background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:auto}
.ed{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--accent-text);background:var(--accent-soft);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:4px}
.vchip{margin-left:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;font-family:var(--sans);cursor:default}
.vchip.ok{color:var(--ok)} .vchip.err{color:var(--err)} .vchip.warn{color:var(--warn)}
.validation-msg{display:none;padding:7px 11px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.45}
.validation-msg.err{display:block;background:var(--err-soft);color:var(--err)}
.validation-msg.warn{display:block;background:var(--warn-soft);color:var(--warn)}
.validation-msg.ok{display:block;background:var(--ok-soft);color:var(--ok)}
.file.active{overflow:visible}
.file.active .file-h{border-radius:11px 11px 0 0}
.addwrap{position:relative;margin-left:auto}
.actionwrap{position:relative;margin-left:auto}
.actionwrap+.addwrap{margin-left:0}
.actionbtn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:3px 8px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:var(--text-soft);font:600 10.5px var(--sans);cursor:pointer}
.actionbtn:hover,.actionbtn[aria-expanded="true"]{background:var(--bg-soft);color:var(--accent-text)}
.actionmenu{position:absolute;top:calc(100% + 6px);right:0;z-index:24;width:225px;display:none;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg-panel);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
.actionmenu.open{display:block}
.actionmenu button,.context-menu button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;width:100%;padding:8px 11px;border:0;background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text);font:12px var(--sans);text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
.actionmenu button:hover,.context-menu button:hover{background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-text)}
.actionmenu button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed;background:var(--bg-panel)}
.menu-ico{width:18px;color:var(--text-mut);font-family:var(--mono);text-align:center}
.menu-key{margin-left:auto;color:var(--text-mut);font:9.5px var(--mono)}
.menu-sep{height:1px;background:var(--border)}
.addmenu{position:absolute;top:calc(100% + 6px);right:0;z-index:12;width:240px;background:var(--bg-panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:11px;box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.18);overflow:hidden;display:none}
.addmenu.open{display:block}
.addmenu .ai{display:block;width:100%;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text);text-align:left}
.addmenu .ai:hover{background:var(--accent-soft)}
.addmenu .ai .n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent-text)}
.addmenu .ai .d{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-mut)}
.runbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0 0}
.bottom{margin-top:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:13px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-panel)}
.btabs{display:flex;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-soft)}
.btab{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:11px 18px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-soft);cursor:pointer;border:0;border-right:1px solid var(--border);background:transparent}
.btab i{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);opacity:.8}
.btab.on{background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--accent-text);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 var(--accent)}
.livechip{margin-left:auto;align-self:center;padding-right:14px;font-size:11px;color:var(--ok);font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}
.livechip .d{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ok)}
.secbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:16px 0 10px;padding:5px 2px 7px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:transparent}
.secbar .st{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--text-mut)}
.chev{margin-left:auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:4px 7px;border:0;border-radius:7px;background:transparent;color:var(--text-mut);cursor:pointer;font:600 10.5px var(--sans)}
.chev:hover{background:var(--bg-soft);color:var(--accent-text)}
.chev-icon{font-size:14px;line-height:1;transition:transform .18s}.chev.collapsed .chev-icon{transform:rotate(-90deg)}
/* chatbot */
.chat-launcher{position:fixed;right:22px;bottom:20px;z-index:42;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:11px 16px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 65%,var(--border));border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font:600 13px var(--sans);box-shadow:0 9px 28px rgba(0,89,76,.24);cursor:pointer}
.chat-launcher:hover{filter:brightness(.96);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.chat-launcher .spark{font-size:16px;line-height:1}
.chatpanel{position:fixed;right:22px;bottom:72px;z-index:41;width:min(390px,calc(100vw - 32px));height:min(520px,calc(100vh - 105px));border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:15px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-panel);box-shadow:0 18px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.22);display:flex;flex-direction:column;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none;transform:translateY(12px) scale(.98);transform-origin:bottom right;transition:opacity .18s ease,transform .18s ease,visibility .18s}
.chatpanel.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible;pointer-events:auto;transform:none}
.chat-head{padding:8px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-mut);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.chat-head .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}
.chat-close{margin-left:auto;width:28px;height:28px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:7px;background:transparent;color:var(--text-mut);font-size:19px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer}
.chat-close:hover{border-color:var(--border);background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text)}
.chat-msgs{padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex:1;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;overflow-y:auto;min-height:110px}
.msg{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start}
.msg.user{flex-direction:row-reverse}
.msg .av{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:600}
.msg.user .av{background:var(--bg-soft);color:var(--text-mut)}
.msg.bot .av{background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-text)}
.msg .bub{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:12px;max-width:80%}
.msg.user .bub{background:var(--bg-soft)}
.msg.bot .bub{background:var(--accent-soft)}
.msg .bub code{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;background:var(--bg-panel);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:5px}
.chat-sugg{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:0 16px 10px}
.chat-sugg .q{font-size:12px;padding:4px 11px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;color:var(--text-soft);cursor:pointer;background:var(--bg-panel)}
.chat-sugg .q:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-text)}
.chat-tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 16px 9px;color:var(--text-mut);font-size:11px}
.chat-tools select{margin-left:auto;padding:4px 7px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px;background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text);font:11px var(--sans)}
.chat-in{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:11px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-soft)}
.chat-in input{flex:1;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text);font-size:13.5px;font-family:var(--sans);outline:none}
.chat-in input:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}
.chat-in input:disabled,.chat-in button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}
.msg.bot.warning .bub{background:var(--warn-soft);color:var(--warn)}
.msg.bot.error .bub{background:var(--err-soft);color:var(--err)}
.msg.thinking .bub{color:var(--text-mut);font-style:italic}
.chat-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:7px;color:var(--text-mut);font-size:10.5px}
.chat-meta .scope{padding:1px 6px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;background:var(--bg-panel)}
.chat-citations{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;margin-top:8px}
.chat-citations a{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--accent-text);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor}
.chat-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:9px}
.chat-action{border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:7px;padding:4px 8px;background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text);font:600 10.5px var(--sans);cursor:pointer}
.chat-action:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-text)}
.chat-local{margin-left:auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;color:var(--ok)}
.chat-local::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}
/* comments */
.gh-note{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-mut);margin:2px 0 8px}
.gh-note a{cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent)}
.cmt{display:flex;gap:12px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.avatar{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-text)}
.avatar.a2{background:var(--warn-soft);color:var(--warn)}
.cmt-main{min-width:0;flex:1}
.cmt-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:4px}
.cmt-top .nm{font-weight:600;font-size:14px}
.cmt-top .tm{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-mut)}
.mtag{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-text);text-transform:uppercase}
.cmt-body{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6}
.cmt-body code{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;background:var(--bg-code);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:5px}
.cmt-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.react{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-soft);cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:2px 10px;background:var(--bg-panel)}
.react:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
.react.on{background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-text);border-color:transparent}
.composer{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:16px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.composer .cb{flex:1;min-width:0}
.composer textarea{width:100%;min-height:70px;resize:vertical;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px}
.composer textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent)}
.composer .cbar{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:8px}
.term-out{padding:14px 16px 4px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;white-space:pre-wrap;min-height:120px;max-height:220px;overflow-y:auto}
.term-out .ok{color:var(--ok)} .term-out .mut{color:var(--text-mut)} .term-out .er{color:var(--err)} .term-out .cmd{color:var(--accent-text)}
.term-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-soft)}
.term-in .pr{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;font-family:var(--mono)}
.term-in input{flex:1;min-width:0;border:none;outline:none;background:transparent;color:var(--text);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px}
.term-in .ret{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--text-mut);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:5px;padding:1px 6px}
.sugg{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:8px 16px 0;min-height:14px}
.sugg .s{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;padding:2px 9px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;color:var(--text-soft);cursor:pointer;background:var(--bg-panel)}
.sugg .s:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-text)}
.sugg .s b{color:var(--accent-text)}
.apic{padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.apic .row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.apic select,.apic input{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text)}
.apic input.ep{flex:1;min-width:200px}
.apic textarea{width:100%;min-height:64px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;padding:9px 11px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-panel);color:var(--text);resize:vertical}
.apic pre{margin:0;padding:12px;background:var(--bg-code);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:var(--text)}
.apihint{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-mut)}
.studioph{padding:26px 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;text-align:center;min-height:120px}
.studioph .txt{max-width:340px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-soft)}
.wip{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--warn);background:var(--warn-soft);padding:2px 9px;border-radius:20px}
.note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-mut);margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed var(--border)}
/* modal */
.modal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:50;padding:20px}
.modal.open{display:flex}
.modal-box{background:var(--bg-panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;max-width:580px;width:100%;max-height:82vh;overflow:auto;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
.modal-h{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--bg-panel)}
.modal-h .mt{font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}
.modal-x{cursor:pointer;color:var(--text-mut);font-size:20px;background:none;border:none;line-height:1}
.modal-b{padding:14px 18px}
table.data{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px}
table.data th{text-align:left;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-mut);font-size:10.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
table.data td{padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px}
table.data tr:nth-child(even) td{background:var(--bg-soft)}
@media(min-width:981px){
  .stage>.panel.side{height:424px}
}
@media(max-width:980px){
  .nav{display:none}
  .stage{grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,.7fr) minmax(0,2fr)}
  .stage>.panel.side:last-child{grid-column:1/-1}
}
@media(max-width:720px){
  .stage{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .stage>.panel.side:last-child{grid-column:auto}
  .files{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .search{display:none}
  .jobflow{align-items:stretch;flex-direction:column}
  .jfnode,.jfnode.transform{width:100%;min-width:0}
  .jfarr{transform:rotate(90deg);align-self:center;line-height:1}
  .runstate{margin-left:0;align-self:center}
}
@media(max-width:620px){
  .examples{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center}
  select.exsel{min-width:0;width:100%}
  .exhint{display:none}
  .run-main{grid-column:1/-1;width:100%;justify-content:center;margin:0}
  .term-in .ret{display:none}
  .btabs{overflow-x:auto}
  .btab{padding:10px 14px}
  .livechip{padding-right:10px}
  .yaml-editor{min-height:320px;grid-template-columns:36px minmax(0,1fr)}
  .yaml-gutter{padding-right:6px}
  .editor-foot{padding-left:42px}
  .chat-launcher{right:12px;bottom:12px}
  .chatpanel{left:10px;right:10px;bottom:66px;width:auto;height:min(520px,calc(100dvh - 86px));transform-origin:bottom center}
  .chat-sugg{flex-wrap:nowrap;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:12px}
  .chat-sugg .q{flex:0 0 auto}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div class="brand">
    <svg class="logo" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 3v6M12 9c0 4-4 4-4 9M12 9c0 4 4 4 4 9M8 18a1.4 1.4 0 1 0 0 .01M16 18a1.4 1.4 0 1 0 0 .01M12 3a1.4 1.4 0 1 0 0-.01"/></svg>
    Hydra Guide
  </div>
  <nav class="nav"><a href="/playground/" class="active">Playground</a><a href="/learn/">Learn</a><a href="/guide/">Guide</a><a href="/migrate/">Migrate</a></nav>
  <div class="spacer"></div>
  <button class="search" type="button" aria-label="Search the Hydra DSL">Search the DSL… <span class="k">⌘K</span></button>
  <button class="iconbtn" id="themeBtn" title="Toggle light / dark" aria-label="Toggle theme"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4"/></svg></button>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="pgbar">
    <h1>Playground</h1><span class="badge">no install needed</span>
    <div class="modes" role="group" aria-label="Playground complexity">
      <button class="modebtn on" type="button" data-mode="guided" aria-pressed="true">Guided</button>
      <button class="modebtn" type="button" data-mode="project" aria-pressed="false">Project</button>
    </div>
    <div class="right"><button class="btn sm" id="shareBtn">↗ Share</button><button class="btn sm" id="exportBtn">⇩ Export</button></div>
  </div>

  <div class="examples">
    <span class="exlab">Examples</span>
    <select class="exsel" id="exSel" aria-label="Load an example"></select>
    <span class="exhint">5–10 ready cases per source</span>
    <button class="btn primary run-main" id="runBtn">▶ Run pipeline</button>
  </div>

  <div class="secbar"><span class="st">Pipeline builder</span><button class="chev" data-target="stageWrap" aria-label="Hide Pipeline builder"><span class="chev-label">Hide</span><span class="chev-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></button></div>
  <div class="jobflow" id="jobFlow" aria-label="Current job flow">
    <div class="jfnode"><div class="n" id="flowSource">orders</div><div class="s">CSV source</div></div>
    <div class="jfarr" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
    <div class="jfnode transform"><div class="n" id="flowSteps">filter → aggregate → sort</div><div class="s" id="flowStepCount">3 transformations</div></div>
    <div class="jfarr" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
    <div class="jfnode"><div class="n" id="flowDest">out</div><div class="s" id="flowDestMeta">CSV · replace</div></div>
    <div class="runstate ok" id="runState" role="status" aria-live="polite">Ready</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stage guided" id="stageWrap">
    <div class="panel side">
      <div class="panel-h">Sources</div>
      <div class="body" id="srcCatalog"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="files">
      <div class="file mut"><div class="file-h"><span class="d"></span>sources.yaml<span class="role">· where data comes from</span><span class="lk">generated</span></div>
        <textarea spellcheck="false" readonly id="fSources">sources:
  orders:
    type: csv
    connection: &#123;&#125;
    extract:
      table: ./data/orders.csv
      batch_size: 100</textarea></div>
      <div class="file active"><div class="file-h"><span class="d"></span>transformations.yaml<span class="ed">edit me</span><span class="vchip ok" id="vstat" title="valid" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div class="actionwrap"><button class="actionbtn" id="editorActionsBtn" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false">Actions <span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></button><div class="actionmenu" id="editorActions" role="menu">
        <button type="button" role="menuitem" data-action="undo"><span class="menu-ico">↶</span>Undo<span class="menu-key">Ctrl Z</span></button>
        <button type="button" role="menuitem" data-action="redo"><span class="menu-ico">↷</span>Redo<span class="menu-key">Ctrl ⇧ Z</span></button>
        <div class="menu-sep"></div>
        <button type="button" role="menuitem" data-action="validate"><span class="menu-ico">✓</span>Validate document</button>
        <button type="button" role="menuitem" data-action="fix"><span class="menu-ico">✦</span>Fix automatically</button>
        <div class="menu-sep"></div>
        <button type="button" role="menuitem" data-action="studio"><span class="menu-ico">↗</span>Open in Hydra Studio</button>
      </div></div><div class="addwrap"><button class="hbtn" id="hAddStep" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false">＋ step ▾</button><div class="addmenu" id="addMenu" role="menu"></div></div></div>
        <div class="yaml-editor" id="yamlEditor">
          <div class="yaml-gutter" id="yamlGutter" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="yaml-code">
            <pre class="yaml-highlight" id="yamlHighlight" aria-hidden="true"></pre>
            <textarea class="yaml-input" spellcheck="false" id="fTransform" aria-label="Transformations YAML editor" aria-describedby="editorHelp">transformations:
  steps:
    - filter:
        expr: amount > 50
    - aggregate:
        by: [status]
        agg:
          total:  &#123; func: sum,   col: amount &#125;
          orders: &#123; func: count, col: order_id &#125;
    - sort:
        by: [total]
        ascending: false</textarea>
            <div class="ac-panel" id="acPanel" role="listbox" aria-label="YAML autocomplete suggestions"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="editor-foot" id="editorHelp"><span><kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Space</kbd> autocomplete</span><span><kbd>Tab</kbd> insert</span><span class="editor-source" id="editorSource">orders · source schema</span></div>
        <div class="validation-msg" id="validationMsg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="file mut"><div class="file-h"><span class="d"></span>pipeline.yaml<span class="role">· the job manifest</span><span class="lk">generated</span></div>
        <textarea spellcheck="false" readonly id="fPipeline">version: "1.0"
pipeline:
  name: orders_pipeline
  from: orders
  to: out
  transformations: transformations</textarea></div>
      <div class="file mut"><div class="file-h"><span class="d"></span>destinations.yaml<span class="role">· where data goes</span><span class="lk">generated</span></div>
        <textarea spellcheck="false" readonly id="fDest">destinations:
  out:
    type: csv
    connection: &#123;&#125;
    load:
      table: ./out/by_status.csv
      mode: replace</textarea></div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel side">
      <div class="panel-h">Destinations <span style="text-transform:none;font-weight:400;color:var(--text-mut)">live</span></div>
      <div class="body">
        <div class="dcap">Target — set by example, or pick type + mode</div>
        <div class="destrow"><select class="destsel" id="destSel" aria-label="Destination type"></select><select class="destsel" id="modeSel" aria-label="Write mode"></select></div>
        <div id="dstCard"></div>
        <div class="wrote" id="wrote"></div>
        <div><div class="dcap">Output preview</div><table class="mini" id="dstPreview"></table></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


  <div class="secbar"><span class="st">Run output — CLI · API · Studio</span><button class="chev" data-target="bottomWrap" aria-label="Hide Run output"><span class="chev-label">Hide</span><span class="chev-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></button></div>
  <div class="bottom" id="bottomWrap">
    <div class="btabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Run interfaces">
      <button class="btab on" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-b="cli"><i>›_</i> CLI</button>
      <button class="btab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-b="api"><i>&#123; &#125;</i> API</button>
      <button class="btab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-b="studio"><i>◧</i> Studio</button>
      <span class="livechip" id="liveChip"><span class="d"></span>interactive</span>
    </div>
    <div data-bb="cli">
      <div class="term-out" id="cliOut"></div>
      <div class="sugg" id="cliSugg"></div>
      <div class="term-in"><span class="pr">$</span><input id="cliIn" spellcheck="false" placeholder="type a command…  try: hdrctl run pipeline.yaml" aria-label="Hydra CLI command" autocomplete="off"><span class="ret">↵ enter</span></div>
    </div>
    <div data-bb="api" style="display:none">
      <div class="apic">
        <div class="row">
          <select id="apiMethod"><option>POST</option><option>GET</option></select>
          <input class="ep" id="apiEp" list="epList" value="/api/run" spellcheck="false">
          <datalist id="epList"><option value="/api/run"><option value="/api/status/r_8f3a21"><option value="/api/workflows"><option value="/api/sources"></datalist>
          <button class="btn primary sm" id="apiSend">Send</button>
        </div>
        <div class="apihint" id="apiHint"></div>
        <textarea id="apiBody" spellcheck="false"></textarea>
        <pre id="apiResp">// response appears here</pre>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-bb="studio" style="display:none">
      <div class="studioph"><span class="wip">simulator — coming next</span>
        <div class="txt">The same job becomes a visual workflow on the Studio canvas. We'll design the Studio simulator in a later pass.</div>
        <button class="btn primary" id="studioBtn">Open in Studio ↗</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="secbar"><span class="st">Discussion</span><button class="chev" data-target="discWrap" aria-label="Hide Discussion"><span class="chev-label">Hide</span><span class="chev-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></button></div>
  <div id="discWrap">
    <div class="gh-note"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-3.16 19.49c.5.09.68-.22.68-.48v-1.7c-2.78.6-3.37-1.34-3.37-1.34-.45-1.16-1.11-1.47-1.11-1.47-.91-.62.07-.61.07-.61 1 .07 1.53 1.03 1.53 1.03.89 1.53 2.34 1.09 2.91.83.09-.65.35-1.09.63-1.34-2.22-.25-4.55-1.11-4.55-4.94 0-1.09.39-1.98 1.03-2.68-.1-.25-.45-1.27.1-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.02a9.5 9.5 0 0 1 5 0c1.91-1.29 2.75-1.02 2.75-1.02.55 1.38.2 2.4.1 2.65.64.7 1.03 1.59 1.03 2.68 0 3.84-2.34 4.68-4.57 4.93.36.31.68.92.68 1.85v2.74c0 .27.18.58.69.48A10 10 0 0 0 12 2Z"/></svg> Powered by GitHub Discussions — <a id="ghSignin">sign in with GitHub</a> · <span id="cmtCount">2</span> comments</div>
    <div id="cmtList">
      <div class="cmt"><div class="avatar">PS</div><div class="cmt-main"><div class="cmt-top"><span class="nm">priya-s</span><span class="tm">2 days ago</span></div><div class="cmt-body">The type × mode picker is great — I didn't realise a CSV can't <code>upsert</code> until it got greyed out. Nice guardrail.</div><div class="cmt-actions"><span class="react" data-n="7">👍 <b>7</b></span></div></div></div>
      <div class="cmt"><div class="avatar a2">HY</div><div class="cmt-main"><div class="cmt-top"><span class="nm">hydra-team</span><span class="mtag">maintainer</span><span class="tm">1 day ago</span></div><div class="cmt-body">Thanks! That matrix comes straight from each connector's declared capabilities.</div><div class="cmt-actions"><span class="react" data-n="4">👍 <b>4</b></span></div></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="composer"><div class="avatar" style="background:var(--bg-soft);color:var(--text-mut)">you</div><div class="cb"><textarea id="cmtIn" placeholder="Add to the discussion…  Markdown supported."></textarea><div class="cbar"><button class="btn primary sm" id="cmtBtn">Comment</button></div></div></div>
  </div>

  <p class="note">The Hydra DSL assistant runs locally from the validated learning corpus. Sources, execution, CLI, API and comments remain simulated in this prototype.</p>
</div>

<button class="chat-launcher" id="chatLauncher" aria-controls="chatWrap" aria-expanded="false"><span class="spark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>Ask me :)</button>
<aside class="chatpanel" id="chatWrap" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="chatTitle" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="chat-head"><span class="dot"></span><span id="chatTitle">Ask Hydra · DSL assistant</span><span class="chat-local">local</span><button class="chat-close" id="chatClose" aria-label="Close Ask Hydra">×</button></div>
  <div class="chat-msgs" id="chatMsgs" aria-live="polite"></div>
